      "text": "Great news.  \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 \n\nThe World Cup is always better when superstars play.\n\n\nFabrizio Romano (@FabrizioRomano)\n\n\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 BREAKING: NEYMAR JR WILL GO TO THE WORLD CUP.\n\nCalled up by Carlo Ancelotti. \ud83d\udca3\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/FabrizioRomano/status/2056481188957594067#m",
