    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I thought this was satire.  \ud83d\ude02\n\n\nAxios (@axios)\n\nEXCLUSIVE: Cuba has acquired more than 300 military drones and recently began discussing plans to use them to attack U.S assets, according to classified intelligence shared with Axios.\n\nThe intelligence could become a pretext for U.S. military action.\naxios.com/2026/05/17/us-mili\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/axios/status/2055990456111005966#m",
